{%- comment -%}
  Local city landing pages (not linked in nav/footer; found through search + links between city pages).
  City copy lives in the case block below, keyed by page handle. Add a city: create a page with
  template suffix "city", handle custom-hats-<city>-nc, and add a matching "when" block.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign F = 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0974/8453/7988/files/' -%}
{%- case page.handle -%}
  {%- when 'custom-hats-burlington-nc' -%}
    {%- assign city = 'Burlington' -%}{%- assign county = 'Alamance County' -%}
    {%- assign img1 = 'work-ricoma-stitching.jpg?v=1793158026' -%}{%- assign img1alt = 'Custom trucker hats being stitched on our embroidery machines' -%}
    {%- assign img2 = 'work-jkole-property-care.jpg?v=1793158677' -%}{%- assign img2alt = 'Custom embroidered trucker hats for a local property care company' -%}
    {%- capture lead -%}Threadbreak is a Burlington embroidery shop. Every hat is stitched or laser engraved right here, so Burlington businesses get custom hats from a neighbor instead of a faceless print warehouse.{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture intro -%}<p>Whether you run a landscaping crew off Church Street, a shop near downtown, or a team that plays at City Park, we make custom embroidered and leather patch hats with your logo, starting at just 5 hats.</p><p>Order online any time, approve your free mockup, and pick your hats up from us in Burlington by appointment. Or let us ship them to your door with free USPS shipping.</p>{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture popular -%}<li>Landscaping, lawn care and tree crews</li><li>Contractors, HVAC, plumbing and electrical companies</li><li>Restaurants, breweries and local shops</li><li>Rec leagues, school teams and Elon area groups</li>{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture nearby -%}Graham, Elon, Gibsonville, Haw River, Mebane, Whitsett and the rest of Alamance County{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture q1 -%}Can I pick up my hats in Burlington?{%- endcapture -%}{%- capture a1 -%}Yes. We're based in Burlington, so local pickup is available by appointment. Choose pickup or free USPS shipping when you order, and we'll reach out when your hats are ready.{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture q2 -%}Do you make hats for Burlington businesses that only need a few?{%- endcapture -%}{%- capture a2 -%}Yes. Our minimum is 5 hats, and you can split them across colors of the same hat. Prices drop at 10, 24, 48 and 96 hats.{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture q3 -%}How long do custom hats take?{%- endcapture -%}{%- capture a3 -%}You'll get a mockup showing your logo's size and placement within 48 hours. Production is 2 to 4 weeks after you approve it. Need them sooner? Email help@threadbreak.com before you order.{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- when 'custom-hats-graham-nc' -%}
    {%- assign city = 'Graham' -%}{%- assign county = 'Alamance County' -%}
    {%- assign img1 = 'work-allstar-112fp.jpg?v=1793158026' -%}{%- assign img1alt = 'Grey Richardson 112FP trucker hats with an embroidered logo' -%}
    {%- assign img2 = 'work-whos-frank-patch.jpg?v=1793158026' -%}{%- assign img2alt = 'Black trucker hats with laser engraved leatherette patches' -%}
    {%- capture lead -%}Custom hats for Graham businesses, crews and teams, made just down the road in Burlington. 5 hat minimum, free digitizing and a free mockup on every order.{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture intro -%}<p>Graham is the Alamance County seat and right next door to our shop, which makes it one of the easiest places for us to serve. From businesses around the courthouse square to crews working all over the county, we put your logo on hats your team will actually wear.</p><p>Pick embroidery for bold, colorful logos or a laser engraved leather patch for detailed ones. Then pick up in Burlington by appointment or get free USPS shipping.</p>{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture popular -%}<li>Local shops, salons and restaurants</li><li>County contractors and trade companies</li><li>Churches, nonprofits and community groups</li><li>Youth sports and school teams</li>{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture nearby -%}Burlington, Haw River, Swepsonville, Saxapahaw, Mebane and southern Alamance County{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture q1 -%}Is Threadbreak close to Graham?{%- endcapture -%}{%- capture a1 -%}Yes. Our shop is in neighboring Burlington, so Graham customers can pick up by appointment. We also ship free by USPS.{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture q2 -%}Can I see my design before you make the hats?{%- endcapture -%}{%- capture a2 -%}Always. Within 48 hours of your order we send a free digital mockup showing your logo's size and placement on the hat. Nothing is made until you approve it.{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture q3 -%}What does it cost?{%- endcapture -%}{%- capture a3 -%}Most custom embroidered hats run $17 to $36 each depending on the hat and quantity, with digitizing and the mockup included. Leather patch hats are often a little less.{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- when 'custom-hats-mebane-nc' -%}
    {%- assign city = 'Mebane' -%}{%- assign county = 'Alamance and Orange Counties' -%}
    {%- assign img1 = 'work-camo-duck-otto.jpg?v=1793158026' -%}{%- assign img1alt = 'Otto camo snapbacks with a detailed embroidered logo' -%}
    {%- assign img2 = 'A75A3466-AEE7-40E6-80B5-72E4F7E1818E.jpg?v=1792644743' -%}{%- assign img2alt = 'A run of black custom hats with gold embroidered numbers' -%}
    {%- capture lead -%}Custom embroidered and leather patch hats for Mebane businesses and teams, made a few exits up I-40/85 in Burlington.{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture intro -%}<p>Mebane keeps growing, with new businesses, neighborhoods and teams popping up all along the interstate. A good logo hat is one of the simplest ways to look established, and we make them in small runs starting at 5 hats.</p><p>We handle digitizing for free, send a mockup within 48 hours, and stitch everything in-house. Pick up in Burlington by appointment or get free USPS shipping straight to Mebane.</p>{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture popular -%}<li>New and growing small businesses</li><li>Builders, landscapers and home service companies</li><li>Retail, food and service businesses</li><li>Rec teams, clubs and events</li>{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture nearby -%}Efland, Hillsborough, Haw River, Graham, Burlington and western Orange County{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture q1 -%}Do you deliver custom hats to Mebane?{%- endcapture -%}{%- capture a1 -%}We ship free by USPS, or you can pick up from our Burlington shop by appointment, which is a short drive from Mebane.{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture q2 -%}What hats do you recommend for a work crew?{%- endcapture -%}{%- capture a2 -%}The Richardson 112 trucker is our most popular all-around pick. For outdoor crews, rope hats and waterproof performance caps hold up well. See our guide to the best hats for crews.{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture q3 -%}Is there a minimum order?{%- endcapture -%}{%- capture a3 -%}Yes, 5 hats per logo. You can mix colors within the same hat style, and the price drops at 10, 24, 48 and 96 hats.{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- when 'custom-hats-greensboro-nc' -%}
    {%- assign city = 'Greensboro' -%}{%- assign county = 'Guilford County' -%}
    {%- assign img1 = '07217139-5CCE-441B-B790-0029094697DC.jpg?v=1786337803' -%}{%- assign img1alt = 'Stack of black and red custom trucker hats' -%}
    {%- assign img2 = 'CB9EEB3B-03FD-426E-8729-DE59065D9AEB.jpg?v=1792646636' -%}{%- assign img2alt = 'Black trucker hats with copper leatherette patches' -%}
    {%- capture lead -%}Custom embroidered and leather patch hats for Greensboro businesses, teams and brands, made in-house in nearby Burlington.{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture intro -%}<p>Greensboro has everything from long-running family companies to new brands, food spots and student groups around UNCG and NC A&amp;T. Whatever you're repping, we make custom hats with your logo, with no setup fees and a 5 hat minimum.</p><p>Build your order online, get a free mockup within 48 hours, and we'll stitch or engrave it in Burlington. Pick up by appointment or get free USPS shipping anywhere in Greensboro.</p>{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture popular -%}<li>Company and staff hats</li><li>Brand merch for local apparel and lifestyle brands</li><li>Restaurants, coffee shops and breweries</li><li>Clubs, teams and campus organizations</li>{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture nearby -%}Jamestown, Summerfield, Oak Ridge, Pleasant Garden, Whitsett, Gibsonville and the rest of Guilford County{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture q1 -%}Do you make custom hats for Greensboro businesses?{%- endcapture -%}{%- capture a1 -%}Yes. We're a short drive away in Burlington and make hats for Triad businesses of every size, starting at 5 hats. Pickup is available by appointment, or we ship free by USPS.{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture q2 -%}Can you make hats to sell as merch?{%- endcapture -%}{%- capture a2 -%}Yes. Many brands use our leather patch or embroidered hats as merch. Detailed logos usually look best as a laser engraved patch.{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture q3 -%}Do you charge for digitizing or setup?{%- endcapture -%}{%- capture a3 -%}No. Digitizing, setup and your mockup are free on every order, and there's no stitch limit on front embroidery.{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- when 'custom-hats-high-point-nc' -%}
    {%- assign city = 'High Point' -%}{%- assign county = 'Guilford County' -%}
    {%- assign img1 = '72816A1C-5D40-4732-9FEB-F01282E9C397.jpg?v=1786337803' -%}{%- assign img1alt = 'Black hats with a blue embroidered company logo' -%}
    {%- assign img2 = '4BB936AF-3BDD-41F3-B967-45D2319BCB4E.jpg?v=1792646607' -%}{%- assign img2alt = 'Black trucker with a laser engraved shop logo patch' -%}
    {%- capture lead -%}Custom logo hats for High Point companies, showrooms and teams. Embroidered or laser engraved in-house, 5 hat minimum.{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture intro -%}<p>High Point is known around the world for furniture and High Point Market, and it's full of companies that need to look sharp, from showrooms and suppliers to shops, crews and High Point University groups. A clean logo hat is easy branding your team can wear every day.</p><p>Order online, approve your free mockup within 48 hours, and we'll make your hats in Burlington. Pick up by appointment or get free USPS shipping to High Point.</p>{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture popular -%}<li>Furniture, design and manufacturing companies</li><li>Event and trade show staff hats</li><li>Auto shops, contractors and service crews</li><li>Teams, clubs and university groups</li>{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture nearby -%}Jamestown, Archdale, Thomasville, Trinity, Greensboro and the southern Triad{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture q1 -%}Can you make hats for a trade show or market?{%- endcapture -%}{%- capture a1 -%}Yes. Order early, since production is 2 to 4 weeks after you approve your mockup. If you have a hard date, email help@threadbreak.com before you order and we'll tell you what's possible.{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture q2 -%}Embroidery or leather patch?{%- endcapture -%}{%- capture a2 -%}Embroidery is best for bold logos with color. Leather patches are best for detailed logos and a clean, premium look. We'll tell you honestly which will look better for your logo.{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture q3 -%}How do I get my hats?{%- endcapture -%}{%- capture a3 -%}Free USPS shipping to High Point, or pick up from our Burlington shop by appointment.{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- when 'custom-hats-winston-salem-nc' -%}
    {%- assign city = 'Winston-Salem' -%}{%- assign county = 'Forsyth County' -%}
    {%- assign img1 = '2736EC88-FDD3-4C5D-BBA3-F70364DE24BE.jpg?v=1786337802' -%}{%- assign img1alt = 'Black Otto snapback with an embroidered motorsports logo' -%}
    {%- assign img2 = '0D8A4AAE-FDDE-4263-8FAA-69A69D9A2C80.jpg?v=1792646570' -%}{%- assign img2alt = 'Black rope snapback with a red laser engraved patch' -%}
    {%- capture lead -%}Custom embroidered and leather patch hats for Winston-Salem businesses, brands and teams, shipped free from our Triad shop.{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture intro -%}<p>From downtown and the Innovation Quarter to shops, crews and Wake Forest area groups, Winston-Salem has no shortage of businesses and teams that want their logo on a good hat. We make them in small runs starting at 5 hats, with no setup fees.</p><p>Order online, approve your mockup within 48 hours, and we'll stitch or engrave your hats in Burlington and ship them free by USPS. Local pickup is available by appointment too.</p>{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture popular -%}<li>Company and crew hats</li><li>Breweries, restaurants and local brands</li><li>Race teams, car clubs and shops</li><li>Teams, clubs and campus groups</li>{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture nearby -%}Kernersville, Clemmons, Lewisville, Pfafftown, Walkertown and the rest of Forsyth County{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture q1 -%}Do you ship custom hats to Winston-Salem?{%- endcapture -%}{%- capture a1 -%}Yes, with free USPS shipping. You can also pick up from our Burlington shop by appointment.{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture q2 -%}Can I order more later with the same logo?{%- endcapture -%}{%- capture a2 -%}Yes. Your stitch file is saved after your first order, so reorders are quick and easy.{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture q3 -%}What's the smallest order?{%- endcapture -%}{%- capture a3 -%}5 hats per logo. You can split them across colors of the same hat style.{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- when 'custom-hats-raleigh-nc' -%}
    {%- assign city = 'Raleigh' -%}{%- assign county = 'Wake County' -%}{%- assign show_fan = true -%}
    {%- assign img1 = '19A80ECD-D3B8-4E97-A565-CEF7C37F1A3D.jpg?v=1792644744' -%}{%- assign img1alt = 'Black flat bill hat with a front logo and side embroidery' -%}
    {%- assign img2 = '73D7073E-A985-4396-9FD8-50363613C29D.jpg?v=1786337803' -%}{%- assign img2alt = 'Grey and black custom snapbacks with an embroidered logo' -%}
    {%- capture lead -%}Custom embroidered and leather patch hats for Raleigh businesses, teams and brands, plus our Carolina hockey inspired snapbacks made for game day.{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture intro -%}<p>A lot of Raleigh folks know us from our Carolina hockey inspired hats, the meme-worthy snapbacks fans wear to games and watch parties. Those are designed and embroidered in-house, and the same machines make custom hats for Raleigh businesses, crews, bars and rec teams.</p><p>Custom orders start at 5 hats with free digitizing and a free mockup within 48 hours. Everything ships free by USPS to Raleigh, or you can pick up from our Burlington shop by appointment.</p>{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture popular -%}<li>Bars, restaurants and watch party spots</li><li>Company, staff and crew hats</li><li>Beer league, rec and youth hockey teams</li><li>Local brands and merch drops</li>{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture nearby -%}Cary, Apex, Wake Forest, Garner, Knightdale, Morrisville, Holly Springs and the rest of the Triangle{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture q1 -%}Do you ship custom hats to Raleigh?{%- endcapture -%}{%- capture a1 -%}Yes. Custom orders ship free by USPS to Raleigh and the rest of the Triangle. You can also pick up from our Burlington shop by appointment.{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture q2 -%}Can you make hats for our hockey team or watch party crew?{%- endcapture -%}{%- capture a2 -%}Yes. Send us your team or group logo and we'll make it, starting at 5 hats. We can't reproduce official team or league logos, but we're happy to make your own designs.{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture q3 -%}Where can I buy your Carolina hockey hats?{%- endcapture -%}{%- capture a3 -%}Right here on our site. Our premade Carolina hockey inspired snapbacks are made to order and usually ship within 5 business days.{%- endcapture -%}
{%- endcase -%}

<style>
  .tbcity{--purple:#5028AA;--ink:#14121C;--muted:#5c5a68;--line:#E6E3EE;--ice:#F4F1FB;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);font-family:'DM Sans',system-ui,sans-serif}
  .tbcity-hero{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#14121C 0%,#241f33 100%);color:#F7F4F0;padding:150px 20px 46px;text-align:center;border-bottom:5px solid var(--purple)}
  .tbcity-hero .kick{display:inline-block;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#cbbcf5;margin-bottom:10px}
  .tbcity-hero h1{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(40px,7vw,66px);line-height:1;margin:0 auto 14px;max-width:820px}
  .tbcity .tbcity-hero p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#C9C8D4;margin:0 auto 24px;max-width:600px}
  .tbcity-cta{display:inline-block;background:var(--purple);color:#fff;padding:14px 22px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;margin:4px}
  .tbcity-cta.alt{background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}
  .tbcity-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:8px;margin-top:18px}
  .tbcity-chips span{font-size:13px;padding:7px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);color:#e8e6f0}
  .tbcity-wrap{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:40px 20px 10px}
  .tbcity-two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:28px;align-items:center}
  .tbcity h2{font-size:clamp(24px,3.2vw,30px);line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 12px;font-weight:800}
  .tbcity p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2a2638;margin:0 0 14px}
  .tbcity img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;border-radius:16px;aspect-ratio:1/1;object-fit:cover;background:var(--ice)}
  .tbcity-card{background:var(--ice);border-radius:16px;padding:22px}
  .tbcity-card ul{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}
  .tbcity-card li{position:relative;padding-left:24px;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5}
  .tbcity-card li::before{content:"\2713";position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--purple);font-weight:800}
  .tbcity-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:8px}
  .tbcity-steps div{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:18px}
  .tbcity-steps b{display:block;font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:30px;color:var(--purple);line-height:1}
  .tbcity-steps strong{display:block;margin:6px 0 4px;font-size:16px}
  .tbcity-steps span{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}
  .tbcity-faq details{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:0 16px;margin:0 0 10px;background:#fff}
  .tbcity-faq summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;padding:14px 0;list-style:none}
  .tbcity-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
  .tbcity-faq details p{font-size:15.5px;margin:0 0 14px;color:#3d3a4a}
  .tbcity-near{font-size:15px;color:var(--muted)}
  .tbcity-links{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:10px}
  .tbcity-links a{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:8px 13px}
  .tbcity-links a:hover{border-color:var(--purple);color:var(--purple)}
  .tbcity-end{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border-radius:18px;padding:28px 24px;text-align:center;margin:20px 0 50px}
  .tbcity-end h2{color:#fff;font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:36px}
  .tbcity .tbcity-end p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.8)}
  .tbcity-fan{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px}
  .tbcity-fan a{display:block;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);background:#fff}
  .tbcity-fan img{border-radius:0}
  .tbcity-fan span{display:block;padding:10px 12px 2px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.35}
  .tbcity-fan b{display:block;padding:0 12px 12px;font-size:14px;color:var(--purple)}
  @media(max-width:760px){.tbcity-fan{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
  @media(max-width:760px){.tbcity-two{grid-template-columns:1fr}.tbcity-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}.tbcity-hero{padding-top:160px}}
</style>

<div class="tbcity">
  <section class="tbcity-hero">
    <span class="kick">{{ county }}, NC</span>
    <h1>Custom Hats in {{ city }}, NC</h1>
    <p>{{ lead }}</p>
    <a class="tbcity-cta" href="/pages/custom-order">Custom embroidered hats</a>
    <a class="tbcity-cta alt" href="/pages/custom-patch-hats">Leather patch hats</a>
    <div class="tbcity-chips"><span>5 hat minimum</span><span>Free digitizing</span><span>Mockup in 48 hours</span><span>Free USPS shipping</span><span>Pickup by appointment</span></div>
  </section>

  <div class="tbcity-wrap">
    <section class="tbcity-two">
      <div>
        <h2>Logo hats for {{ city }} businesses and teams</h2>
        {{ intro }}
      </div>
      <img src="{{ F }}{{ img1 }}&width=900" alt="{{ img1alt }}" loading="lazy" width="900" height="900">
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="tbcity-wrap">
    <section class="tbcity-two">
      <img src="{{ F }}{{ img2 }}&width=900" alt="{{ img2alt }}" loading="lazy" width="900" height="900">
      <div class="tbcity-card">
        <h2>Popular in {{ city }}</h2>
        <ul>{{ popular }}</ul>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>


  {%- if show_fan -%}
  <div class="tbcity-wrap">
    <h2>Carolina hockey inspired hats</h2>
    <p>Our fan favorite snapbacks, designed and embroidered in-house. Unofficial and not affiliated with the NHL or any team.</p>
    <div class="tbcity-fan">
      {%- for prod in collections['pre-made-hats'].products limit: 4 -%}
        <a href="{{ prod.url }}">{%- if prod.featured_image -%}<img src="{{ prod.featured_image | image_url: width: 500 }}" alt="{{ prod.title | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="500" height="500">{%- endif -%}<span>{{ prod.title | split: '|' | first | strip }}</span><b>{{ prod.price | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</b></a>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:14px"><a class="tbcity-cta" href="/collections/pre-made-hats">Shop all premade hats</a></p>
  </div>
  {%- endif -%}
  <div class="tbcity-wrap">
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <div class="tbcity-steps">
      <div><b>01</b><strong>Build your order</strong><span>Pick your hat, colors and quantity online and upload your logo. Digitizing is free.</span></div>
      <div><b>02</b><strong>Approve your mockup</strong><span>Within 48 hours we send a mockup showing your logo's size and placement.</span></div>
      <div><b>03</b><strong>Pick up or ship</strong><span>We make your hats in 2 to 4 weeks. Pick up in Burlington by appointment or get free USPS shipping.</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="tbcity-wrap tbcity-faq">
    <h2>{{ city }} custom hat FAQ</h2>
    <details><summary>{{ q1 }}</summary><p>{{ a1 }}</p></details>
    <details><summary>{{ q2 }}</summary><p>{{ a2 }}</p></details>
    <details><summary>{{ q3 }}</summary><p>{{ a3 }}</p></details>
    <p class="tbcity-near">Also serving {{ nearby }}.</p>
    <div class="tbcity-links">
      {%- assign cities = 'custom-hats-burlington-nc:Burlington,custom-hats-graham-nc:Graham,custom-hats-mebane-nc:Mebane,custom-hats-greensboro-nc:Greensboro,custom-hats-high-point-nc:High Point,custom-hats-winston-salem-nc:Winston-Salem,custom-hats-raleigh-nc:Raleigh' | split: ',' -%}
      {%- for c in cities -%}{%- assign parts = c | split: ':' -%}{%- if parts[0] != page.handle -%}<a href="/pages/{{ parts[0] }}">Custom hats in {{ parts[1] }}</a>{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
      <a href="/blogs/guides">Hat guides</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="tbcity-wrap">
    <section class="tbcity-end">
      <h2>Get your {{ city }} hats started</h2>
      <p>Made in-house in Burlington, NC. Questions? Email help@threadbreak.com or text (336) 585-6176.</p>
      <a class="tbcity-cta" href="/pages/custom-order">Start a custom order</a>
      <a class="tbcity-cta alt" href="/pages/our-work">See our work</a>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Service",
